{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"DRUPAL-CONTRIB-2026-233","published":"2026-10-21T17:46:29Z","modified":"2026-10-21T18:45:03.373626714Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-114535"],"details":"Swiper is mobile first, layout and gestures wise, it provides great amount of options for designing your own widget and related events.\n\nThis module provides a route for displaying published content entities in a dialog. The route does not sufficiently verify the current user's access to the specific entity.\n\nThis vulnerability is mitigated by the fact that only rendered output is returned, and field-level access controls are still enforced.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"drupal/swiper_formatter","ecosystem":"Packagist:https://packages.drupal.org/8","purl":"pkg:composer/drupal/swiper_formatter?repository_url=https:%2F%2Fpackages.drupal.org%2F8"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.1.2"}],"database_specific":{"constraint":"<2.1.2"}},{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"3.0.1"},{"fixed":"3.1.0"}],"database_specific":{"constraint":">=3.0.1 <3.1.0"}}],"database_specific":{"affected_versions":"<2.1.2 || >=3.0.1 <3.1.0","source":"https://github.com/DrupalSecurityTeam/drupal-advisory-database/blob/main/advisories/swiper_formatter/DRUPAL-CONTRIB-2026-233.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.drupal.org/sa-contrib-2026-233"}],"credits":[{"name":"Joshua Sedler (grevil)","contact":["https://www.drupal.org/u/grevil"]},{"name":"Julian Pustkuchen (anybody)","contact":["https://www.drupal.org/u/anybody"]},{"name":"Ryan Solomon (phizes)","contact":["https://www.drupal.org/u/phizes"]}]}